n 2.0.5:**\r\n\r\n- Fix missing Vulkan video headers\r\n- Use FindPython instead of FindPythonInterp\r\n- Add --version option to command-line interface\r\n- Remove one duplicated check for glGetString(GL_VERSION)\r\n- Fix extensions loading and parsing\r\n- Provide CMake package\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 2.0.5 to version 2.0.6:**\r\n\r\n- Fix eglplatform in header only build not correctly replacing the khrplatform include\r\n- Fix compile warning when GLAD_GLES2_USE_SYSTEM_EGL=1\r\n- Fix: Use include instead of find_package for CMake config\r\n- c: don't warn on undefined GLAD_GLES2_USE_SYSTEM_EGL\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 2.0.6 to version 2.0.7:**\r\n\r\n- Fix resource lookups without setuptools for most recent Python versions\r\n- Fix parsing of most recent Vulkan definitions\r\n- Fix compilation errors with strict flags on recent gcc versions\r\n- example: defines GLAD_GL_IMPLEMENTATION in GLFW example\r\n- ci: bump actions versions\r\n\r\n**Changes from version 2.0.7 to version 2.0.8:**\r\n\r\n- files: updates to latest specifications\r\n- rust: replace static mut references with addr_of\r\n- Replace setup.py with pyproject.toml\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator